{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1450135-animal-and-creature-stats","id":1450135,"title":"Animal and Creature Stats","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-28T22:09:19-07:00","id":1450135,"title":"Animal and Creature Stats","content":"Does anyone know a good resource for animal and creature stats for the Storypath System? I have looked through Trinity Continuum Core, Aberrant, and Aeon and found very little to even start with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26811-uphill-gamer","name":"Uphill Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26811_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T17:21:59-07:00","id":1450238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uphill Gamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1450135-animal-and-creature-stats#post1450135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does anyone know a good resource for animal and creature stats for the Storypath System? I have looked through Trinity Continuum Core, Aberrant, and Aeon and found very little to even start with.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think its up to us.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u201cHumpty had always sat on walls, it was his way.\u201d </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">\u2015 </span></span></span><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Lato\"><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Jasper Fforde, </span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#181818\"><span style=\"font-family:Merriweather\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.goodreads.com/work/quotes/2504943\" target=\"_blank\">The Big Over Easy</a></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1756-mythadvocate","name":"MythAdvocate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"444"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T21:04:12-07:00","id":1450270,"title":"","content":"Look at books from the earlier editions of these games and see what you can repurpose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T21:23:19-07:00","id":1450272,"title":"","content":"You could also look into <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/cc/26/StoryPath-Nexus\" target=\"_blank\">SP Nexus</a></b> recourses - or even <b>Scion</b> gameline materials. Core mechanics of <b>Storypath</b> are more or less the same between <b>Trinity</b> and <b>Scion</b> - only special powers and specifics are different. For example, I run <b>Scion</b> series now. Yesterday on game session I used <b>Trinity Aberrant's </b>T-Rex stats for my modern pulp <b>Scion</b> game, without larger problems. <b><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T21:25:35-07:00","id":1450275,"title":"","content":"Just decide what level of threat you want the creature to be and use one of the Antagonist stat lines from the Anomalies section of the core book. If the animal or creature should have big teeth or claws or something slap on some anomaly powers. Quick and easy animals and creatures.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6-slagheap","name":"Slagheap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-29T21:37:39-07:00","id":1450278,"title":"","content":"^^^ This. Most animals are going to be Minor Characters (p.140) or Minor Threats (p.139). More powerful predators, or large and quick-tempered herbivores (like rhinos), are probably Medium or Moderate threats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}